This repository contains the source code for a personal freelance portfolio,
including original copy, case studies, branding (logo mark, color system,
typography choices), and contact information.

The source is published on GitHub for transparency and as a public artifact
of the author's work. It is NOT released as open source software.

You may:

  * Read and study the code for personal learning.
  * Reference small, idiomatic implementation details (a hook, a utility,
    a Tailwind pattern) in your own work without attribution.

