  * Reproduce, redistribute, deploy, or host this site or any substantial
    portion of its content (including copy, case studies, layout, or
    branding).
  * Use the author's name, photo, contact details, or project descriptions
    to represent yourself or another party.
  * Sell, sublicense, or relicense the code or content.

For permission requests, partnership inquiries, or freelance work, contact
the author at contact@badreddine.dev.
